Selectable=no buildings are never selected (lamps, fences, walls, civ art).

BuildingTypeDef gains Selectable= (default yes; 61 building types say
no). The SelectBuilding cursor classification (both branches) and the
legacy click assignment skip unselectable buildings, so the click falls
through to a ground action. Targeting (attack orders, force-fire) is
untouched. Unit Selectable=no needs nothing: all 6 such types are
Spawned=yes, already pruned from selection. Save format 76. Tests in
test_input.cpp (both schemes: lamp unselectable, pillbox selects).

